WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.763
Validation uses CIFAR10, CIFAR100, and ImageNet.

00:00:03.843 --> 00:00:09.849
Memorization relies on Feldman and Zhang's
precomputed scores and ensembles,

00:00:09.929 --> 00:00:14.333
a thousand models on CIFAR100 and a hundred on ImageNet,

00:00:14.413 --> 00:00:17.135
using Small Inception and ResNet50.

00:00:17.215 --> 00:00:22.740
Privacy experiments train ResNet18 with DP-SGD
across several budgets.
